WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:21.478
"A car!" shouted Toad. "Of course!"

2
00:00:21.479 --> 00:00:24.878
He danced in circles.

3
00:00:24.879 --> 00:00:28.609
"I must have one! Vroom!

4
00:00:28.610 --> 00:00:34.281
Why have I waited so long?"

5
00:00:34.282 --> 00:00:38.473
"Help me," cried the bird in the cage.

6
00:00:38.474 --> 00:00:46.392
"You'll be all right," said Mole to the bird.

7
00:00:46.393 --> 00:00:50.570
"Let's set the cart right," said Mole.

8
00:00:50.571 --> 00:00:55.292
Rat and Mole tried to push the cart up.

9
00:00:55.293 --> 00:01:02.743
"One, two, three, push!" they said.

10
00:01:02.744 --> 00:01:07.714
The cart was too heavy.

11
00:01:07.715 --> 00:01:11.358
"One more try," said Mole.

12
00:01:11.359 --> 00:01:16.544
"Toad," said Rat, "please help with the cart."

13
00:01:16.545 --> 00:01:21.071
"It's just a silly yellow cart," said Toad.

14
00:01:21.072 --> 00:01:26.270
"Who cares? Soon I will have a car!"

15
00:01:26.271 --> 00:01:30.875
"What can we do with him?" asked Mole.

16
00:01:30.876 --> 00:01:33.234
"Nothing," said Rat.

17
00:01:33.235 --> 00:01:35.943
"He found a new interest.

18
00:01:35.944 --> 00:01:38.737
He'll be like this for days."

19
00:01:38.738 --> 00:01:45.206
"Vroom! Vroom!" shouted Toad.

20
00:01:45.207 --> 00:01:50.037
Rat and Mole decided to leave the cart.

21
00:01:50.038 --> 00:01:53.651
"The wheel is broken anyway," said Rat.

22
00:01:53.652 --> 00:01:57.172
"We'll walk to the next town," said Mole.

23
00:01:57.173 --> 00:02:02.433
Rat carried the birdcage and Mole led the horse.

24
00:02:02.434 --> 00:02:05.782
"Vroom!" said Toad.

25
00:02:05.783 --> 00:02:07.735
He ran to catch up.

26
00:02:07.736 --> 00:02:11.651
"Don't worry," he said cheerfully.

27
00:02:11.652 --> 00:02:14.759
"We'll find a stable for the horse.

28
00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:21.493
Then we'll take a train home. Zip zip!"

29
00:02:21.494 --> 00:02:26.489
The next day the riverbank was quiet.

30
00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:30.403
Rat and Mole sat fishing by the water.

31
00:02:30.404 --> 00:02:32.630
A rabbit ran up.

32
00:02:32.631 --> 00:02:36.557
"Did you hear the news?" she said.

33
00:02:36.558 --> 00:02:42.836
"Toad has bought a big fancy car!"
